Package: StatARPLS
Title: Automatic Statistical Baseline Correction via Asymmetrically Reweighted Penalized Least Squares
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Taruna", "Dagur", , "dagurtaru@myvuw.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(StudentID = "300686751"))
Description: Provides a from-first-principles implementation of Asymmetrically
    Reweighted Penalized Least Squares (ARPLS) baseline correction for
    spectroscopic data, extended with automatic regularisation parameter
    selection and robustness diagnostics not available in existing
    baseline-correction tooling. All core routines are implemented natively
    in R and C++ (via 'Rcpp').
